     "display": "這裡是 DataSci Ocean，這集我們來看 Claude Code 的迴圈。",
     "hold": 0.3,
     "screen": [
      "Claude Code"
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "i2",
     "display": "Claude Code 是 Anthropic 推出的 agent，在命令列裡幫你寫程式。",
     "hold": 0.25,
     "screen": []
    },
    {
